      "id": "s1-intro",
      "type": "intro",
      "label": null,
      "title": "Punch — Stay With Me",
      "content": "이번 레슨에서는 **-아/어서**를 배워요.\n이유를 설명하거나 순서를 연결할 때 써요.\n\nPunch의 **Stay With Me**는 운명적인 만남과 깊은 감정을 노래해요.\n드라마 '도깨비' OST로 유명한 곡이에요.",
      "contentEnglish": "In this lesson, you'll learn **-아/어서** — used to give reasons (because) or connect sequential actions (and then).\n\nPunch's **Stay With Me** sings about a fateful encounter and deep emotions. It's famous as the OST for the drama 'Goblin'.",
      "musicPlaying": true
    },
